WEBVTT

1
00:00:02,480 --> 00:00:04,480
No injury to bones or muscles

2
00:00:04,480 --> 00:00:06,480
After a while, I can run all over the mountains again

3
00:00:06,480 --> 00:00:13,090
What's up?

4
00:00:13,090 --> 00:00:21,070
Look at his team firing off cannons

5
00:00:21,070 --> 00:00:24,000
What does this mean? Blind Bear

6
00:00:24,000 --> 00:00:29,630
It's not a bear, it's a wild boar.

7
00:00:29,630 --> 00:00:32,620
The old boar was driven out by the pigs

8
00:00:32,620 --> 00:00:34,620
Rolling in mud pits with pine oil all year round

9
00:00:34,620 --> 00:00:36,620
The mud armor hanging on the body is harder than the iron plate

10
00:00:36,620 --> 00:00:39,910
If he runs into the mountains, ask him to mount an armored cannon.

11
00:00:39,910 --> 00:00:45,430
Look at his team’s shots

12
00:00:45,430 --> 00:00:47,430
Blast him out of his nest
